msgid "Documentation changes"
msgstr "文档变更"

#: ../../development/contributing.md:77 fe4e3579369d410baae9f226a091371e
msgid "`style`"
msgstr "`style`"

#: ../../development/contributing.md:77 d9ae589d76f44f58ab2de6540683be94
msgid "Code style changes (formatting, no logic change)"
msgstr "代码风格变更（格式化，无逻辑变更）"

#: ../../development/contributing.md:77 530a494ea440432ba71afe444e41b950
msgid "`refactor`"
msgstr "`refactor`"

#: ../../development/contributing.md:77 b727ec4d1f6048568c2da9906865db2c
msgid "Code refactoring (no feature or fix)"
msgstr "代码重构（无新功能或修复）"

#: ../../development/contributing.md:77 23e3a852606149ecb63fd14e31788293
msgid "`test`"
msgstr "`test`"

#: ../../development/contributing.md:77 f0995c3372a7480da3645278aa267e08
msgid "Adding or updating tests"
msgstr "添加或更新测试"

#: ../../development/contributing.md:77 f56f9821ed1d463aac6fbaac73b3fe0e
msgid "`chore`"
msgstr "`chore`"

#: ../../development/contributing.md:77 1a80a967e600419ea5d3dbdf6db358d2
msgid "Build process or auxiliary tool changes"
msgstr "构建流程或辅助工具变更"

#: ../../development/contributing.md:137 c60a6b67e3fd47c490675fd10faa294a
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "示例"

#: ../../development/contributing.md:145 9cf7e24dd10042f0941f6215b2a40732
msgid "Pull Request Process"
msgstr "Pull Request 流程"

#: ../../development/contributing.md:147 e3928e2b3201450ca37bbf09492981d2
msgid "**Create a branch** from `main` with a descriptive name"
msgstr "从 `main` **创建分支**，使用描述性名称"

#: ../../development/contributing.md:148 9efc4f983c0a408f900ca6646b5bc572
msgid "**Make your changes** and commit with conventional commit messages"
msgstr "**进行更改**并使用规范的提交消息进行提交"

#: ../../development/contributing.md:149 76b1ddf63f994afcbbfa8719f10e7ee7
msgid "**Run checks** before submitting:"
msgstr "提交之前**运行检查**："

#: ../../development/contributing.md:155 8614bb7766384d359537b43795e4f9ec
msgid "**Push** your branch and open a Pull Request"
msgstr "**推送**您的分支并打开 Pull Request"

#: ../../development/contributing.md:156 e1fda0336a864d51868f5923c99ff397
msgid "**Describe** your changes clearly in the PR description"
msgstr "在 PR 描述中**清楚地描述**您的更改"

#: ../../development/contributing.md:157 b73da80aa28f49448647036f15e4a114
msgid "**Wait for review** — maintainers will review your code"
msgstr "**等待审核** —— 维护者将审查您的代码"

#: ../../development/contributing.md:159 737560d491394d46920cf08c3341cdcb
msgid ""
"If your change updates contributor workflow, environment setup, or "
"developer-facing behavior, update the relevant pages under "
"`docs/development/` in the same PR."
msgstr "如果您的变更更新了贡献者工作流、环境配置或面向开发者的行为，请在同一个 PR 中同步更新 `docs/development/` 下对应的页面。"

#: ../../development/contributing.md:161 154aef6dd9ab4df19a88b326219b0d39
msgid ""
"If your change updates agent or deep-research behavior, verify that tool "
"names, privilege boundaries, session persistence, and contributor docs "
"stay aligned."
msgstr "如果您的变更更新了智能体或 deep-research 行为，请确认工具名称、权限边界、会话持久化与贡献者文档保持一致。"

#: ../../development/contributing.md:163 7e5259cfb66147bbac8ada65572d2349
msgid "PR Checklist"
msgstr "PR 检查清单"

#: ../../development/contributing.md:165 89b8a9a9768e459893d5960da32fd079
msgid "Code follows the project's coding style"
msgstr "代码遵循项目的编码风格"

#: ../../development/contributing.md:166 24eed3680174494681995a599402463d
msgid "Tests pass (`npm test`)"
msgstr "测试通过（`npm test`）"

#: ../../development/contributing.md:167 0b7655afd37c495899b10c9e40bc9ecd
msgid "Lint passes (`npm run lint`)"
msgstr "Lint 通过（`npm run lint`）"

#: ../../development/contributing.md:168 77180321f2464d218a2aeb799bac80bf
msgid "Build succeeds (`NEXT_TELEMETRY_DISABLED=1 npm run build`)"
msgstr "构建成功（`NEXT_TELEMETRY_DISABLED=1 npm run build`）"

#: ../../development/contributing.md:169 33e3d0c5ee1a44a88d40722f413c803d
msgid "Documentation updated (if applicable)"
msgstr "文档已更新（如适用）"

#: ../../development/contributing.md:171 1715fdcacb374f8d96656d95543ae664
msgid "Code of Conduct"
msgstr "行为准则"

#: ../../development/contributing.md:173 e06aa0fc79c14edcbbd96d75b496cac0
msgid ""
"Please be respectful and constructive in all interactions. We aim to "
"create a welcoming and inclusive community."
msgstr "请在所有互动中保持尊重和建设性。我们致力于创建一个友好和包容的社区。"

#: ../../development/contributing.md:175 99e70ad07a024f329f42aa969ff4833e
msgid "Reporting Issues"
msgstr "报告问题"

#: ../../development/contributing.md:177 0231e718946a47eb9f7ea2bec6861e44
msgid ""
"Use [GitHub Issues](https://github.com/SpectrAI-"
"Initiative/InnoClaw/issues) to report bugs or request features"
msgstr ""
"使用 [GitHub Issues](https://github.com/SpectrAI-"
"Initiative/InnoClaw/issues) 报告错误或提出功能请求"

#: ../../development/contributing.md:178 cfa90db4d5f547e49f72c3e80e5783eb
msgid "Include clear steps to reproduce any bugs"
msgstr "包含清晰的错误复现步骤"

#: ../../development/contributing.md:179 24f8c97f095b4959a859aeca64eb98cc
msgid "Provide environment details (OS, Node.js version, browser)"
msgstr "提供环境详情（操作系统、Node.js 版本、浏览器）"
